# ============================================================
# WHAT IS VERSIONED (anti-patterns - explicit allow)
# ============================================================
# These files ARE versioned per B3-2a/b/c sub-decisions:
# - config/site_model.yml (facility topology source of truth)
# - config/procedures/*.yml (executable MOP YAMLs)
# - config/knowledge/*.md (GraphRAG corpus)
# - config/pue_targets.yml (PUE thresholds)
# - data/corpus/tier*/ (RAG corpus markdown - 20 docs)
# - scripts/_archive/<sprint>/*.py (historical iteration scripts archived)
# - scripts/_archive/<sprint>/*.ps1 (PowerShell orchestrators archived)
